=\"3\"></ellipse><path d=\"M3 5V19A9 3 0 0 0 21 19V5\"></path><path d=\"M3 12A9 3 0 0 0 21 12\"></path></svg></div><div><h2 class=\"text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-tight\">Chưa kết nối cơ sở dữ liệu</h2><p class=\"text-stone-500 font-medium\">Ứng dụng hiện chưa được cấu hình biến môi trường kết nối đến Supabase.</p></div></div><div class=\"space-y-6\"><div class=\"bg-stone-50 border border-stone-200 rounded-2xl p-6\"><h3 class=\"font-semibold text-stone-900 mb-4 flex items-center gap-2\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-settings size-5 text-stone-500\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M9.671 4.136a2.34 2.34 0 0 1 4.659 0 2.34 2.34 0 0 0 3.319 1.915 2.34 2.34 0 0 1 2.33 4.033 2.34 2.34 0 0 0 0 3.831 2.34 2.34 0 0 1-2.33 4.033 2.34 2.34 0 0 0-3.319 1.915 2.34 2.34 0 0 1-4.659 0 2.34 2.34 0 0 0-3.32-1.915 2.34 2.34 0 0 1-2.33-4.033 2.34 2.34 0 0 0 0-3.831A2.34 2.34 0 0 1 6.35 6.051a2.34 2.34 0 0 0 3.319-1.915\"></path><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"3\"></circle></svg>Hướng dẫn khắc phục:</h3><ol class=\"list-decimal list-inside space-y-4 text-stone-600\"><li class=\"leading-relaxed\">Đăng nhập vào<!-- --> <a href=\"https://supabase.com/dashboard/project/_/settings/api\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"text-amber-600 font-semibold hover:underline\">Supabase Dashboard</a>.</li><li class=\"leading-relaxed\">Lấy thông tin <b>Project URL</b> và<!-- --> <b>Project API Keys (anon public)</b>.</li><li class=\"leading-relaxed\">Tạo file <code>.env.local</code> ở thư mục gốc của dự án.</li><li class=\"leading-relaxed\">Thêm cấu hình sau vào file:<div class=\"mt-3 bg-stone-900 text-stone-100 p-4 rounded-xl flex items-start gap-3 overflow-x-auto text-sm font-mono\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-terminal size-5 text-stone-400 shrink-0 mt-0.5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 19h8\"></path><path d=\"m4 17 6-6-6-6\"></path></svg><pre><code>NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=your_supabase_url\nNEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_PUBLISHABLE_DEFAULT_KEY=your_supabase_anon_key</code></pre></div></li><li class=\"leading-relaxed\">Khởi động lại server: <code>npm run dev</code> (hoặc bun dev).</li></ol></div><div class=\"flex justify-center pt-2\"><a class=\"px-6 py-3 bg-amber-500 hover:bg-amber-600 text-white font-semibold rounded-xl transition-colors shadow-sm\" href=\"/\">Tải lại trang sau khi cấu hình</a></div></div></div></div><a class=\"absolute top-6 left-6 z-20 flex items-center gap-2 text-stone-500 hover:text-stone-900 font-semibold text-sm transition-all duration-300 bg-white/60 px-5 py-2.5 rounded-full shadow-sm border border-stone-200 hover:border-stone-300 hover:shadow-md\" href=\"/\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-left size-4\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m12 19-7-7 7-7\"></path><path d=\"M19 12H5\"></path></svg>Trang chủ</a><footer class=\"py-8 text-center text-sm text-stone-500 bg-transparent border-none mt-auto relative z-10 backdrop-blur-sm\"><div class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4\"><p class=\"flex items-center justify-center gap-2 opacity-80 hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity\"><a href=\"https://github.com/homielab/giapha-os\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"font-semibold text-stone-600 hover:text-amber-700 transition-colors inline-flex items-center gap-1.5\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" fill=\"none\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><pat